      "content": "it just feels so selfish to keep going when i know i'm just gonna pass this shit on to someone else. like, if i'm gone, the chain actually stops. i wouldn't be hurting anyone anymore, and the cycle wouldn't have a way to continue through me. wouldn't that be a more peaceful way to just... protect everyone?",
